{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/47ae47ec00d841c88c49b7c45864b305.avif?t=1757321999\" width=621 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Welcome to the ranger system! I'll be your guide throughout the Steam page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, I'll give you a rundown of your basic moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy, you can shoot bullets sideways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mint can shoot them vertically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plum shoots them back and forth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly, Lemon\u2019s bullets can clear diagonal formations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your weapon is not merely a gun! Parry or hook to special objects to advance through the levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump, Dash and Brake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jump over obstacles, dash to go faster or brake if you're feeling overwhelmed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go over every reward you can earn on each level now. They are as follow: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Score 5 stars ranks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be ranked based on your performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to break the chain or get hit as that will hurt your ranking!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get a memory picture every time you clear a level with a high score! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranger Medals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.poster.avif?t=1757321999\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.webm?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.mp4?t=1757321999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find ranger medals! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They unlock levels and sometimes even boss encounters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's about it! I'll let you discover everything else as you go! Good luck! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 20 playable levels with its secret paths.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 playable characters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of different enemies and stages, each taking place in a different time of day!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 bosses to fight, and a final fight across the entire map!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split your team to take on 2 paths at the same time!<br>Take on hard mode. You'll receive twice the time penalty for each hit you take. Become untouchable!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inky Mode! Once you beat the game, you will unlock new modes to play. Inky can shoot in all directions. Everything goes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the game to try the arcade mode. Can you beat every level without taking a break?</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2787680?t=1757321999","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/d2262452c83857311a65fdc98c5164a4b2cdbc1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757321999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/0ebdc72988301cb8a92265db43023caedde0505f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757321999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/0ebdc72988301cb8a92265db43023caedde0505f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757321999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3226270,"d